        "section": "About the Program",
        "title": "",
        "text": "Riverside Community Garden runs free growing workshops for neighbors of every experience level. This registration tells us who is coming, which organization you are with, and confirms you have read the program release. It takes about six minutes."
      },
      {
        "section": "Release and Signature",
        "title": "",
        "text": "[Release text: the program's participation and photo release, word for word.]"
